WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
06:20 — Track intervals. At the track Daniel keeps the phone in hand for interval notes — pace, rest, how the left knee felt — one log instead of a separate running app he never opens.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
12:40 — Desk mobility. Between client calls he opens a short mobility block on the iPad at his desk, twelve minutes, then back to email without changing clothes.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
18:50 — Strength session. After work the phone logger takes squats and accessories; last week’s numbers are already there so he is not guessing under fluorescent lights.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
21:00 — Week review. Laptop charts at night show volume trending up gently — strength and runs in one place, no spreadsheet archaeology.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.500
21:25 — Coach tip. A rules-based Smart Coach tip appears on the laptop — not an LLM sermon, just a cue he accepts or dismisses with one tap.

